#  and can be added to your project. Our canonical global Gitignores for JetBrains are
#  available at:
#  https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and:
#  https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/IDEA.gitignore

